# The owner's office door, seen from the lobby side: a walnut door with a
# plain brass plate (two screws and an engraved rule, no name) and a glass
# side light. Frame "closed" first, so it is the default; "open" shows the
# leaf swung back and the room beyond. Covers two D cells. The top tile is
# left clear, so the office's floor shows through the opening above the door
# and an Odd walks in through it, not over a wall.
sprite owner-door
size 32 48
layer wall
footprint 2 1
origin 0 32
tag wall door owner

frame closed
